# B. Users & Staff

## E-B01 Staff leaves while packing orders
- Behaviour: Reassign tasks; removed user loses access; order continues.
- Must not: Cancel orders solely because staff left.

## E-B02 Sole owner removed
- Behaviour: Block removal until ownership transfer.
- Must not: Leave business with zero owners.

## E-B03 Invited user already belongs to another business
- Behaviour: Block invite acceptance under current single-business rule.
- Must not: Attach one user to two businesses.

## E-B04 Permissions revoked mid-session
- Behaviour: Next action denied; session may continue read-only or reauth per policy.
- Must not: Allow privileged action after revoke.

## E-B05 Delivery boy deactivated while out for delivery
- Behaviour: Keep delivery record; reassign; notify managers.
- Must not: Mark delivery complete automatically.

## E-B06 Accountant tries to accept orders
- Behaviour: Deny unless explicitly granted.
- Must not: Infer permission from financial access.

## E-B07 User deleted locally expects history gone
- Behaviour: History remains attributed to removed user identity.
- Must not: Cascade-delete orders/payments.

## E-B08 Phone number change for active user
- Behaviour: Verify new phone; audit old/new; sessions may invalidate.
- Must not: Allow unverified phone swap on owner accounts without checks.

