# H. Invoicing Exceptions

## E-H01 Invoice before dispatch
- Behaviour: Block unless explicit bill-ahead policy enabled for that business relationship.
- Must not: Default-allow pre-dispatch invoicing.

## E-H02 Invoice qty > delivered/billable qty
- Behaviour: Block.
- Must not: Over-bill.

## E-H03 Duplicate invoice for same fully billed lines
- Behaviour: Block double billing of same billable qty.
- Must not: Create double liability.

## E-H04 Tax rate changed after order before invoice
- Behaviour: Use legally/product-defined snapshot policy (order-time vs invoice-time) consistently and visibly.
- Must not: Ambiguous mixed tax without rule.

## E-H05 Void after partial payment
- Behaviour: Generally forbidden; use credit note / controlled reversal policy.
- Must not: Void away paid amounts casually.

## E-H06 Invoice issued then order rejected historically impossible
- Behaviour: State machine prevents; if data repair needed, admin-controlled with audit only.
- Must not: Normal user path creating impossible combo.

## E-H07 Round-off manipulated to alter totals unfairly
- Behaviour: Round-off constrained to policy limits.
- Must not: Arbitrary round-off as hidden discount/tax evasion tool.

