# K. Notifications & Messaging

## E-K01 Notification click after permission lost
- Behaviour: Show access denied; notification may mark read.
- Must not: Reveal entity payload beyond permission.

## E-K02 Message says “payment approved”
- Behaviour: No payment status change.
- Must not: Treat chat as approval.

## E-K03 Notification generation failure
- Behaviour: Business event remains; retry notify; surface undelivered if critical and possible.
- Must not: Roll back invoice/order because SMS/inbox failed (default).

## E-K04 Flood of low-stock alerts
- Behaviour: Digest/throttle per product.
- Must not: Spam unbounded duplicates every minute.

